        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "Experience the world of retail in Shop Master - VR Supermarket Simulator, where you can run and explore three store types: general store, cash & carry, and mega store. Dive into engaging tasks such as customer billing, restocking shelves, and managing inventory. Each store presents unique challenges and an immersive environment that mirrors real-life supermarket operations. Whether you’re organizing products or helping customers, this VR game combines fun and skill-building to create a dynamic, interactive experience. Perfect for fans of simulation and retail strategy!",
